    >
      <div class="flex w-full px-2 pb-6 justify-between">
        <h1 class="text-3xl pr-4 tracking-tighter font-bold text-focus">
          Dante Nardo
        </h1>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
          <ContactLink href="https://github.com/TheDolentCity">
            <ContactLinkIcon>
              <Github class="w-4 h-4" />
            </ContactLinkIcon>
            <ContactLinkText>TheDolentCity</ContactLinkText>
          </ContactLink>
          <ContactLink href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dante-nardo/">
            <ContactLinkIcon>
              <Linkedin class="w-4 h-4" />
            </ContactLinkIcon>
            <ContactLinkText>dante-nardo</ContactLinkText>
          </ContactLink>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
          <ContactLink
            href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/San+Diego,+CA/@32.8242405,-117.3891468,10z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x80d9530fad921e4b:0xd3a21fdfd15df79!8m2!3d32.715738!4d-117.1610838!16zL20vMDcxdnI"
          >
            <ContactLinkIcon>
              <Globe class="w-4 h-4" />
            </ContactLinkIcon>
            <ContactLinkText>Rochester, NY</ContactLinkText>
          </ContactLink>
          <ContactLink href="https://dantenardo.dev">
            <ContactLinkIcon>
              <AppWindow class="w-4 h-4" />
            </ContactLinkIcon>
            <ContactLinkText>https://dantenardo.com</ContactLinkText>
          </ContactLink>
        </div>
        <SectionItem href="/education">
          <SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
            <SectionItemHeader>
              B.S. Game Design & Development
            </SectionItemHeader>
            <SectionItemDate>Dec 2018</SectionItemDate>
          </SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
          <SectionItemParagraph>
            Rochester Institute of Technology
          </SectionItemParagraph>
        </SectionItem>
      </div>
      <Section>
        <SectionHeader className="mt-6 md:mt-0 print:mt-0">
          Experience
        </SectionHeader>
        <SectionSeparator />
        <SectionBody>
          <SectionItem href="/work/cloud-platform">
            <SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
              <SectionItemHeader>Senior Software Engineer</SectionItemHeader>
              <SectionItemSubtitle>at Biosero Inc.</SectionItemSubtitle>
              <SectionItemDate>Nov 2020 - Present</SectionItemDate>
            </SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
            <SectionItemList>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Architected platform-wide consolidation effort, assembling
                presentations, technical specifications, and prototypes to get
                buy-in from management, resulting in reduced cloud hosting
                costs, reduced API response time across the board, and the
                creation of over 1000 integration tests for increased stability.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Led development of SaaS web portals, streamlining the management
                and distribution of subscriptions, licenses, software, and
                documentation for customers.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Designed a relational database schema for legacy cloud platform
                and after dozens of trials to ensure correctness, migrated all
                production data from NoSQL Cosmos DB to a PostgreSQL instance
                with 0% data loss, 100% relational mapping, and less than 1 hour
                of downtime.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Worked closely with Devops team to build out our
                infrastructure-as-code Terraform implementation, simplifying
                deployments, future infrastructure updates, and the creation of
                new cloud environments.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Created component library with new design system so that
                internal teams could build half a dozen applications without
                ever needing to build components themselves.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Implemented a web-based version of a desktop visual programming
                tool which enabled the company's new web apps to render no-code
                solutions without needing to install legacy software.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <!-- <SectionItemListItem>
                Continuously deployed single page applications, REST APIs, and
                gRPC microservices to Kubernetes clusters with GitHub actions,
                resolving bugs in all environments with efficiency.
              </SectionItemListItem> -->
            </SectionItemList>
          </SectionItem>
          <SectionItem href="/work/viasat-outages">
            <SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
              <SectionItemHeader>Software Engineer</SectionItemHeader>
              <SectionItemSubtitle>at Viasat Inc.</SectionItemSubtitle>
              <SectionItemDate>Jan 2019 - Apr 2020</SectionItemDate>
            </SectionItemHeaderHorizontal>
            <SectionItemList>
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Developed real-time web app that provided accurate satellite
                internet quality information based on FAA flight plans or the
                live trajectory of aircraft, allowing customers to avoid or plan
                for internet outages.
              </SectionItemListItem>
              <!-- <SectionItemListItem>
                  Implemented computational geometry library in Java to process flight paths and determine when and where outages would occur.
                </SectionItemListItem> -->
              <SectionItemListItem>
                Implemented computational geometry library along with a
                serverless microservice using webhooks, Amazon S3, SQS, Lambdas,
                and Dynamo DB to reduce file upload processing from seconds to
                milliseconds.
              </SectionItemListItem>
            </SectionItemList>
          </SectionItem>
        </SectionBody>
        <!-- <SectionHeader className="mt-6">Education</SectionHeader>
